2nd Sub. S.B. 281
Senior Nutrition Private Donation Incentives
Senate Amendments Amendment 1 February 27, 2026 11:20 AM
Senator Keven J. Stratton proposes the following amendments:
1. Line 22 through 28:
22 (1) As used in this section:
23 (a) "Area need" means the food and nutrition needs of seniors in a geographical area
24 served by a local area agency, as determined by:
25 (i) the total number of seniors receiving {or} and on the waiting list for home delivered meals;
26 and
27 (ii) the percentage of individuals described in Subsection (1)(a)(i) compared to the
28 total population.
